            <ArticleTitle>Atopy parameters in asthmatic children increase with accumulation of null-alleles of glutathione-S-transferase M1.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>460-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Atopy parameters (total IgE, skin prick test, and peripheral blood eosinophil count) in children with atopic bronchial asthma depend on the number of glutathione-S-transferase M1 mutant alleles in the genotype and on family history of asthma.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
